{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">有跨境巴士營運商引入電動巴士，期望降低成本。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">跨境巴士「港澳一號」早上舉行「啟航」儀式，旅遊界立法會議員江旻憓都有出席。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.EBUS-1230_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20263NMvKZin6y1790324687.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.EBUS-1230_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">電動巴士的外觀，與傳統柴油巴士分別不大。營辦商指電巴兩小時可充滿電，可行駛約750公里，即可來回港澳約三次，較柴油巴士少一次來回。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.EBUS-1230_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026yU73ZndUbr1790324700.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.EBUS-1230_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">不過，營辦商指由於燃油價格急增，電巴維修及營運成本僅油巴一半。至於何時引入第二輛，就指要視乎實際運作後再決定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T08:59:26.761966+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}